### Get movies
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/movies?title=godfather&genres=crime,drama&page=1&page_size=5&sort=year

### Create movie 
POST http://localhost:4000/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Moana","year":2016,"runtime":"107 mins","genres":["animation","adventure"]}

### Create movie - invalid request
POST http://localhost:4000/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"","year": 2016,"runtime":"107 mins","genres":["animation","adventure"]}

### Get movie 
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/movies/61


### Update movie
PATCH http://localhost:4000/v1/movies/61
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Movie1","year": 2000,"runtime":"107 mins","genres":["animation","adventure"]}

### Update movie partially
PATCH http://localhost:4000/v1/movies/61
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Movie2","year": 2005}


### Delete movie
DELETE http://localhost:4000/v1/movies/24

### healthcheck
GET http://localhost:4000/v1/healthcheck
